{"overview":"مادری که در غم از دست دادن دخترش در یک تصادف خودرو که باعث کما شدن شوهر ستمگرش شد، گرفتار می‌شود. او در حالی که به سمت یک سقوط سورئال به تاریکی می‌رود، حملات خواب‌گردی‌اش تشدید می‌شود. تحت تعقیب تصاویری شبح‌وار از شوهرش در داخل خانه، او با مرزهای مبهم بین واقعیت و کابوس دست و پنجه نرم می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A grieving mother is haunted by the tragic loss of her daughter in a car accident that left her abusive husband in a coma. As she battles a surreal descent into darkness, her sleepwalking episodes intensify. Plagued by haunting visions of her husband inside their home, she grapples with the blurred lines between reality and nightmare.","tagline_en":"When night falls, every memory can be a nightmare.","runtime":89,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Brandon Auman"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"هایدن پانتیر","role":"Sarah","photo":"/beFQeFN0KcF2MsM5DRFE8YTMDjQ.jpg","en":"Hayden Panettiere"},{"name":"جاستین چتوین","role":"Michael","photo":"/nEHYlooGSwRzkhze1rQ7DOpJXLD.jpg","en":"Justin Chatwin"},{"name":"بورلی دی آنجلو","role":"Gloria","photo":"/8fYQIA8dAaA4GOTxOFSKIvTqzi.jpg","en":"Beverly D'Angelo"},{"name":"میشا بارتون","role":"Joelle","photo":"/j3eZsKKIz4uWdVwAvokv8GHU21w.jpg","en":"Mischa Barton"},{"name":"Lori Tan Chinn","role":"Bai Zhao","photo":"/i0pvjYbtcGZzVKfqknkA2eBLy1S.jpg"},{"name":"Eric Lutes","role":"Doctor Henson","photo":"/2BDg05USmUXaYTnLm4csTF5Sq7e.jpg"},{"name":"Kea Ho","role":"Nurse Alexis","photo":"/ptLUdHosyGaKWURDNGx3cHgOAL.jpg"},{"name":"Laird LaCoste","role":"Holden","photo":""},{"name":"Corinne Sweeney","role":"Aimee","photo":""},{"name":"Cathy Salvodon","role":"Aniya","photo":"/u8HdSv77YaGUDYahvkzKscVBDen.jpg"},{"name":"Gene Dante","role":"Lawrence","photo":"/veLqITUXavPw0X4lG0BBjx2wZgu.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Everett","role":"Doctor Langford","photo":"/qYE9yQJSC0GJeCW3qs30RfvwrUS.jpg"}],"trailer":"HSgpBtfxbOA","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/143230